l men are  created equal  that's our equality that we're all  equally children of god so take god out  of the picture i think  we are going to slide rapidly into  an embrace of inequality now in the  classical world yes  but heck look at the 20th century i mean  when god is excluded in a very  systematic way  i think you saw the suspension of rights  and the suspension of equality like mad  so i think it's very important  that god is in the picture and that  we're a nation under god it matters  enormously that's not pious boilerplate  that's at the at the rational  foundations of our democracy  you
 

